s7-3-p2 : Block
s7-3-p2 = prose (cons "Guarded recursion, transition relations, free-monad trees, and coalgebras give different representations of continuing computation, with different available observations and proof principles. A transition system specifies states and labeled steps; an external label becomes an internal interaction when a suitable handler is composed with it. The equality, bisimulation, or refinement needed for a representation change must be established for the selected behavior. Section 7.6 computes one such composition." nil)
